digest":"sha256:853b70cb76d789209afa746591d6a537f9e510d86f7edc1cd4fa17390912f966","download_count":497,"created_at":"2026-10-11T02:32:04Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T02:32:05Z"},{"id":629625597,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4lh1L9","name":"DBX_0.6.40_x64-win7-server2012r2-offline-setup.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msdownload","state":"uploaded","size":183123552,"digest":"sha256:e97b3ef0d7156f970ac4fb8a0095f021ad7700313d071d0b42874f237aeca6a2","download_count":10,"created_at":"2026-10-11T03:06:14Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T03:06:19Z"},{"id":629625596,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4lh1L8","name":"DBX_0.6.40_x64-win7-server2012r2-offline-setup.exe.sha256","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":118,"digest":"sha256:8f3df86699701a0783ae0f77e81518282bfa828dc139d084273ab26cc4572c23","download_count":8,"created_at":"2026-10-11T03:06:14Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T03:06:14Z"},{"id":629624165,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4lh01l","name":"DBX_0.6.40_x64.dmg","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":43055191,"digest":"sha256:33564193f25403560db7001cc483b616c1c6975a579485fc183007e650801283","download_count":15,"created_at":"2026-10-11T03:05:20Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T03:05:22Z"},{"id":629569445,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4lhnel","name":"DBX_0.6.40_x64_en-US.msi","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":38244352,"digest":"sha256:cbbda5167d7f6366538049c15dba7ac8d897b65841c3ee0e88cdc259d4c16fca","download_count":14,"created_at":"2026-10-11T02:32:02Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T02:32:03Z"},{"id":629624224,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4lh02g","name":"DBX_x64.app.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":43014800,"digest":"sha256:3f841d8c04eb9256c807884afe278674c3b93bc58848bba04022753aaf40539a","download_count":21,"created_at":"2026-10-11T03:05:23Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T03:05:25Z"},{"id":629644089,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4lh5s5","name":"latest.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":17011,"digest":"sha256:a412ec2c4896557030a2504fd92f6762cddd12505af7f02f79062f8db86bd5be","download_count":2554,"created_at":"2026-10-11T03:17:40Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T03:17:40Z"}],"body":"### 赞助信息\n\n- 赞助伙伴 HiAPI 入驻，提供图片、视频、音频及文本模型 API（GPT Image 2.5 等），新用户注册赠 200 Credits、充值送 10% 积分，[注册入口](https://www.hiapi.ai/invite/dbx?utm_source=dbx&utm_medium=affiliate&utm_campaign=backlink&utm_content=readme-zh)\n\n### 新功能\n\n- 查询执行期间 PostgreSQL 的 NOTICE/WARNING 消息现在实时显示在消息输出中，Kingbase 的查询消息也会一并捕获展示。\n- SQL 自动补全现在能解析引用先前 CTE 的嵌套 CTE 列 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11738](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11738))\n- 右键表可按弹窗指定的行数生成多行 INSERT 模板，多行占位值按行号区分 (contributed by @xiaohuowa) (PR [#11695](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11695))\n- 结果网格新增\"仅保留值（单列）\"复制格式，单列选择时复制为纯值 JSON 数组，多列选择仍输出对象 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#11731](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11731))\n- XLSX 导出新增\"字段名称与注释分两行表头\"模式，第 1 行为字段名、第 2 行为注释、数据从第 3 行开始 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#11732](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11732))\n- Excel 导入新增\"空字符串识别为 NULL\"选项，未勾选时保留为空字符串 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11734](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11734))\n- Redis 字符串值为序列化 JSON 时以格式化 JSON 呈现并可回写 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11737](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11737))\n- MySQL 结构比较部署新增\"忽略外键检查\"选项，允许以任意顺序删除和重建表 (contributed by @DengQingNian) (PR [#11701](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11701))\n- 搜索快捷键支持快速连按两次同一修饰键（Shift/Cmd/Ctrl/Alt）触发 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#11705](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11705))\n- 新增可自定义快捷键绑定的\"关闭全部标签页\"操作 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#11730](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11730))\n- 侧边栏折叠父节点时递归折叠所有子孙节点 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11719](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11719))\n- 侧边栏表搜索框固定在数据库标题下方，列表滚动时不再随之滚走 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#11706](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11706))\n\n### 改进\n\n- 更新赞助页 HiAPI 充值福利：由\"首充最高加赠 12% 积分\"改为\"充值送 10% 积分\"。\n\n### 修复\n\n- 语句字符串字面量含反斜杠转义时，分页不再因漏判顶层 LIMIT 而追加第二个 LIMIT 导致查询报错 (contributed by @Tong-bit-art) (PR [#11690](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11690))\n- Oracle 连接复制 JDBC URL（含凭据）时原样嵌入用户名和密码，凭据含无法安全嵌入的字符时不再提供该项复制以免复制出的 URL 静默改变密码 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#11692](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11692))\n- 查询结果导出改为透过打开的手动事务读取，导出文件能看到事务中未提交的变更 (contributed by @jeff377) (PR [#11721](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11721))\n- Kingbase 的 json/json[] 列类型不再显示为 jsonb (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11724](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11724))\n- 全量 XLSX 导出中 decimal 列以数值类型写出，不再退化为文本 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11621](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11621))\n- MyBatis XML 实体（如 &gt;=、&lt;=）不再导致 SQL 编辑器把一条语句错误拆分成多段 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#11717](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11717))\n- PostgreSQL 查询结果排序后隐藏的主键列保持隐藏，不再重新出现在网格中 (contributed by @jeff377) (PR [#11720](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11720))\n- 自动补全弹窗（列表与详情）应用配置的编辑器字体 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11725](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11725))\n- 旧版 MongoDB agent 上的单文档 insert()/insertOne() 语句现在可以执行 (contributed by @dienaso) (PR [#11729](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11729))\n- MongoDB 编辑器接受\"复制为 SQL 插入\"生成的 EJSON.deserialize(...) 语句，不再执行报错 (contributed by @dienaso) (PR [#11696](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11696))\n- XLSX 流式导入在工作表 dimension 起始列与实际数据列不一致时保持列对齐正确 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11733](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11733))\n- uniqueidentifier 与 uuid 在跨库迁移/传输时按目标库正确映射（SQL Server ↔ PostgreSQL，MySQL 为 char(36)） (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11728](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11728))\n- MySQL 经 ProxySQL 读写分离连接时不再因 hostgroup 锁定（错误 9006）导致连接失败 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11735](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11735))\n- MCP HTTP 传输对所有协议版本改为无状态服务，客户端长时间暂停后重连不再报 Session not Found (contributed by @KeaneQy) (PR [#11653](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11653))\n- 有弹窗打开时 Cmd+W 关闭最上层弹窗，不再误关背后的标签页 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#11697](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11697))\n- 结构比较和数据比较配置的重命名操作改用铅笔图标 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11714](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11714))\n- HANA 的侧边栏分页加载和对象名筛选不再要求数据库上下文，可直接使用 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11716](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11716))\n- 导入向导在输入无效行范围后能恢复预览加载和导航 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11712](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11712))\n- 仅含单一对象类型的范围（如只有表的 MySQL 库）不再丢失对象计数显示 (contributed by @Abeautifulsnow) (PR [#11698](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11698))\n- 复制以 @ 开头且后跟非 ASCII 字符的文本（如 @张三）不再被加上前导撇号，@SUM(1) 等真正的公式形式仍会被中和 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#11703](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11703))\n- SQL Server 注释读取按扩展属性 class 过滤，索引的 MS_Description 不再串显到列注释上 (contributed by @jeff377) (PR [#11710](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11710))\n\n---\n<!-- dbx-cnb-mirror -->\n> 国内下载：如果 GitHub 下载较慢，可从 [CNB 镜像](https://cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx/-/releases/tag/v0.6.40) 下载桌面端安装包，Docker 镜像从 `docker.cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx:v0.6.40` 拉取。\n","mentions_count":12}
